    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the world of <strong>Horse Runner DX</strong>, a delightful endless runner that combines precise platforming with strategic gameplay. Run through beautiful landscapes, enjoy uplifting music, put together your herd of different horses and compete in increasingly difficult challenges.</p><br><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Simple &amp; Tight Controls</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple one-button controls are super accessible and let you perform perfectly timed jumps. You control the lead horse, all other horses follow you automatically.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Herd-Building</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose an additional horse to join your herd. Each horse functions like an extra life and has a specific power-up that changes the gameplay.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Tricky Challenges</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to earn rewards and push your platforming and strategy skills to the limit. At first the challenges are simple and easy to complete, later ones require good planning.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Cute Pixel Art Graphics</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like you're back in the old days - with honest, straightforward gameplay, colorful, sharp pixel graphics, and if you want, even the look of an old TV.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the world of <strong>Horse Runner DX</strong>, a delightful endless runner that combines precise platforming with strategic gameplay. Run through beautiful landscapes, enjoy uplifting music, put together your herd of different horses and compete in increasingly difficult challenges.</p><br><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Simple &amp; Tight Controls</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple one-button controls are super accessible and let you perform perfectly timed jumps. You control the lead horse, all other horses follow you automatically.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Herd-Building</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose an additional horse to join your herd. Each horse functions like an extra life and has a specific power-up that changes the gameplay.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Tricky Challenges</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.mp4?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to earn rewards and push your platforming and strategy skills to the limit. At first the challenges are simple and easy to complete, later ones require good planning.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Cute Pixel Art Graphics</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.poster.avif?t=1755180280\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.webm?t=1755180280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like you're back in the old days - with honest, straightforward gameplay, colorful, sharp pixel graphics, and if you want, even the look of an old TV.</p>",
    "short_description": "Horse Runner DX is a wholesome, fast-paced platformer with a twist: You play a whole herd of horses! Combine different horses and power-ups, complete increasingly difficult challenges, chase new highscores and enjoy the ride from cute to chaotic fun.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese",
    "reviews": "\u201cWith its 'just one more run' appeal, it's an ideal pick for casual gamers and horse lovers alike.\u201d<br>LadiesGamers<br><br>\u201cAbsolutely lovely pixel art, the horses are well animated and super cute! I really like the environment too!\u201d<br>Steam review<br><br>\u201ca great combo of addictive but chill\u201d<br>Steam review<br>",
